## StoryMe — Azure App Service startup
##
## This Procfile is deployed as part of the backend/ package.
##
## CRITICAL: FastAPI is an ASGI application. It MUST be served by an ASGI
## worker. Oryx auto-detection picks "sync" (WSGI) workers when it detects
## Flask-like patterns, which causes:
##   TypeError: FastAPI.__call__() missing 1 required positional argument: 'send'
##
## By declaring the full gunicorn command here, we override Oryx's auto-
## generated command completely and guarantee UvicornWorker is used.
##
## startup.sh is also present in this package for portal Startup Command use.
## If "Startup Command" is set in Azure App Service → Configuration →
## General settings, that overrides this Procfile. Clear the Startup Command
## field to let Azure use this Procfile.
##
## Worker / timeout rationale:
##   -k uvicorn.workers.UvicornWorker  ASGI worker — required for FastAPI
##   --workers 2                       B1 has 1 vCPU; 2 workers for concurrency
##   --timeout 300                     face blend + PDF generation takes 15-60s
##   --keep-alive 5                    warmup poller connections stay open
##
web: gunicorn -k uvicorn.workers.UvicornWorker server:app --bind=0.0.0.0:$PORT --workers 2 --timeout 300 --keep-alive 5 --access-logfile - --error-logfile - --log-level info

